1
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,380
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:27,760
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,287 --> 00:00:30,640
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:35,360
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,513 --> 00:00:39,040
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:39,933 --> 00:00:42,720
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:48,400
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:55,604
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,604 --> 00:00:58,123
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,123 --> 00:00:59,553
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:04,120
=Episode 13=

12
00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:12,881
I'm sorry.

13
00:01:17,881 --> 00:01:18,481
First,

14
00:01:19,281 --> 00:01:21,600
for dragging you into my personal feud
with Xingzhao Pavilion

15
00:01:22,801 --> 00:01:24,640
and forcing you to stay by my side,

16
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,040
I'm sorry.

17
00:01:27,321 --> 00:01:27,841
Second,

18
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:31,200
for turning a blind eye
to Feng Qingyun's jealousy

19
00:01:31,761 --> 00:01:32,761
and the harm she did to you,

20
00:01:33,321 --> 00:01:36,001
letting you fall deeper and deeper
into danger,

21
00:01:37,321 --> 00:01:38,120
I'm sorry.

22
00:01:39,401 --> 00:01:40,160
Third,

23
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,881
for using you to go after
the Grand Princess,

24
00:01:44,001 --> 00:01:45,281
scheming to draw you into my plans,

25
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:50,361
and getting you caught up
in danger and poisoned...

26
00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:53,881
I'm sorry.

27
00:01:56,481 --> 00:01:58,001
Everything that happened before

28
00:01:59,481 --> 00:02:01,080
was my fault.

29
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:12,080
Come on,

30
00:02:13,001 --> 00:02:15,160
you don't have to apologize, really.

31
00:02:15,921 --> 00:02:17,281
I'm not that bothered by it.

32
00:02:22,921 --> 00:02:25,881
All of that happened before.

33
00:02:26,881 --> 00:02:28,240
The fact that I used you

34
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:31,001
is true.

35
00:02:32,281 --> 00:02:33,481
So the way I am now,

36
00:02:34,441 --> 00:02:36,640
I have no right to ask you to stay.

37
00:02:37,761 --> 00:02:38,921
But Weiyue,

38
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,921
that's not all there is between us.

39
00:02:52,761 --> 00:02:53,680
I like you,

40
00:02:54,961 --> 00:02:55,921
Feng Weiyue.

41
00:02:55,921 --> 00:02:57,760
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

42
00:02:58,987 --> 00:03:00,520
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

43
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,640
Your Highness,

44
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,720
I know that your feelings for me

45
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,441
might be because of Mother.

46
00:03:05,441 --> 00:03:06,080
No.

47
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:08,260
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

48
00:03:08,281 --> 00:03:09,281
I like you.

49
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:11,481
It has nothing to do with anyone else.

50
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:16,960
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

51
00:03:17,881 --> 00:03:19,240
It's my true heart.

52
00:03:19,540 --> 00:03:22,160
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

53
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:24,361
I truly like you.

54
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:25,881
So...

55
00:03:27,401 --> 00:03:28,481
Please stay,

56
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,361
will you?

57
00:03:30,361 --> 00:03:32,080
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

58
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:35,920
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

59
00:03:36,333 --> 00:03:38,720
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

60
00:03:39,189 --> 00:03:41,560
♪This love remains unchanged♪

61
00:03:41,627 --> 00:03:44,320
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

62
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:48,320
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

63
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:52,360
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

64
00:03:52,667 --> 00:03:55,160
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

65
00:03:55,187 --> 00:03:58,920
♪How can I bear a sweet dream
turning into doom♪

66
00:03:59,553 --> 00:04:02,000
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

67
00:04:02,113 --> 00:04:06,200
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

68
00:04:06,933 --> 00:04:08,800
♪I don't regret that vow♪

69
00:04:08,993 --> 00:04:12,760
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪

70
00:04:29,001 --> 00:04:30,120
You feel

71
00:04:31,761 --> 00:04:32,720
nothing for me?

72
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:37,361
Mo Yuya.

73
00:04:40,441 --> 00:04:41,801
Let me tell you a story.

74
00:04:47,361 --> 00:04:48,961
In another world,

75
00:04:49,841 --> 00:04:50,841
there was a girl

76
00:04:51,481 --> 00:04:52,520
also named Feng Weiyue.

77
00:04:53,761 --> 00:04:55,120
She was clever from a young age

78
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:59,080
and fascinated
by how everything in the world worked.

79
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:00,481
One day,

80
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,401
she and her colleague

81
00:05:02,801 --> 00:05:04,881
(Jun Qingye, Head of Spatial Research)
were working on a new spatial product.

82
00:05:04,881 --> 00:05:05,560
(Feng Weiyue,
Spatial Research Team Lead)

83
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,961
That day, there was a thunderstorm.

84
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:10,921
A white light burst from the lab.

85
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,680
She and her colleague

86
00:05:13,961 --> 00:05:17,361
were both sucked in
by a strange magnetic field.

87
00:05:18,761 --> 00:05:22,080
Her soul fell into another world,

88
00:05:23,881 --> 00:05:24,801
landing

89
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:28,401
in some prince's bed.

90
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,640
You mean...

91
00:05:35,801 --> 00:05:38,240
You came from another world?

92
00:05:41,281 --> 00:05:42,200
Feng Weiyue,

93
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:45,640
if you don't want to accept me, fine,

94
00:05:46,281 --> 00:05:47,281
but don't make up

95
00:05:47,281 --> 00:05:49,720
some long story to fool me.

96
00:05:49,921 --> 00:05:50,881
Is it a lie?

97
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:54,040
I think you already know the answer.

98
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,720
What is this?

99
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,801
This is an IV bottle.

100
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,680
This is a recording pen.

101
00:06:00,881 --> 00:06:02,361
These things can't be made

102
00:06:02,361 --> 00:06:03,200
in your era.

103
00:06:03,961 --> 00:06:05,040
Our era?

104
00:06:22,881 --> 00:06:23,640
Mo Yuya,

105
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,761
the person standing before you

106
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:28,560
is a visitor
from another time and space.

107
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:31,361
Now,

108
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:34,720
I finally have a chance to go home.

109
00:06:35,961 --> 00:06:37,560
Please just let me go.

110
00:06:42,401 --> 00:06:43,120
No!

111
00:06:54,361 --> 00:06:56,481
I don't care where you come from.

112
00:06:56,921 --> 00:06:58,240
You became my princess consort.

113
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,361
You messed with me.

114
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,921
Don't think you can just walk away.

115
00:07:19,281 --> 00:07:20,401
Mo Yuya, you scumbag!

116
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:43,361
I'm sorry.

117
00:07:48,321 --> 00:07:49,361
I'll have the divorce letter

118
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:53,321
delivered to you tomorrow.

119
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:57,881
Feng Weiyue,

120
00:07:59,801 --> 00:08:01,401
this is where we part ways.

121
00:08:41,602 --> 00:08:46,360
(Grand Princess's Estate)

122
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:48,641
Your Highness,
may I ask why you summoned me

123
00:08:48,641 --> 00:08:51,561
and my mother here today?

124
00:08:53,521 --> 00:08:55,320
I won't beat around the bush.

125
00:08:55,921 --> 00:08:57,440
That wretch Feng Weiyue

126
00:08:57,721 --> 00:08:59,521
actually faked her death
to make a fool of me.

127
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:01,721
I despise her
with every fiber of my being.

128
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:03,400
I know you feel the same.

129
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:04,801
So

130
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:08,881
I want you to kill her mother,
Madam Bai,

131
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:11,040
to teach her a proper lesson.

132
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,280
Your Highness,

133
00:09:13,721 --> 00:09:17,080
Madam Bai is carrying my husband's son.

134
00:09:17,521 --> 00:09:19,280
And he cares deeply about this child.

135
00:09:19,561 --> 00:09:21,961
I really don't dare.

136
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:26,120
Madam An, don't play
the virtuous concubine with me.

137
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,961
Since you already know it's a boy,

138
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:31,360
even if I hadn't come to you today,

139
00:09:31,761 --> 00:09:35,240
would you really let him
be born safe and sound?

140
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:36,841
In that case,

141
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:40,480
all the years you and your daughter
spent building your position

142
00:09:40,921 --> 00:09:43,040
in the Grand Tutor's Residence
would be wasted, wouldn't it?

143
00:09:46,761 --> 00:09:47,961
You speak the truth, Your Highness.

144
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:51,040
My mother and I
have our concerns about this,

145
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,561
but we still have our fears.

146
00:09:52,801 --> 00:09:55,400
Do you have a way to protect us,
Your Highness?

147
00:09:59,881 --> 00:10:01,240
Once it's done,

148
00:10:01,921 --> 00:10:03,881
I'll petition His Majesty

149
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:06,360
to take you as his sworn sister.

150
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:09,521
Then, once Madam Bai is dead

151
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:11,440
and your status rises,

152
00:10:12,001 --> 00:10:16,641
your mother becoming
a co-principal wife or the main wife

153
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,921
will naturally follow.

154
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,841
- Thank you, Your Highness.
- Thank you, Your Highness.

155
00:10:25,223 --> 00:10:28,596
(Grand Tutor's Residence)

156
00:10:28,641 --> 00:10:30,280
This is the deed
to my lady's noodle shop,

157
00:10:30,601 --> 00:10:32,961
along with the silver she's earned
these past days.

158
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:35,400
She said to leave it all for you,
Madam Bai.

159
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,561
That silly child...

160
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:41,320
What on earth happened

161
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:44,320
that she must divorce Prince of Rong

162
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,681
and go wandering far away?

163
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,480
Could it be

164
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:52,400
that after all these years of failing
to win Prince of Rong's love,

165
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,601
she's thinking of doing
something drastic?

166
00:10:54,801 --> 00:10:55,601
No, Madam Bai.

167
00:10:56,001 --> 00:10:59,440
She said Prince of Rong will come by
later to explain everything to you.

168
00:10:59,921 --> 00:11:01,440
They're parting on good terms.

169
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,601
She asked you not to be sad.

170
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:06,360
Bad news! Mother!

171
00:11:06,681 --> 00:11:08,200
Something's happened to Weiyue!

172
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:10,160
What happened, Qingyun?

173
00:11:10,681 --> 00:11:11,961
The servants said

174
00:11:12,561 --> 00:11:13,440
they think

175
00:11:13,761 --> 00:11:15,400
they saw Weiyue's body.

176
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,320
You're about to give birth.

177
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,561
Stay calm.

178
00:11:20,601 --> 00:11:21,721
Or it might hurt the baby.

179
00:11:22,721 --> 00:11:24,200
Is it really Weiyue?

180
00:11:24,761 --> 00:11:25,961
Where was she found?

181
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:27,360
We're not sure yet.

182
00:11:27,601 --> 00:11:29,120
The body's in the pond
in the back courtyard.

183
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:30,801
We'll know once they pull it out.

184
00:11:33,561 --> 00:11:34,440
Slow down.

185
00:11:38,841 --> 00:11:40,240
Oh, Madam Bai.

186
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:41,961
Where are you going?

187
00:11:42,001 --> 00:11:43,320
Dear! Weiyue...

188
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:44,801
Weiyue is in danger!

189
00:11:44,881 --> 00:11:46,961
It seems she couldn't take it
and jumped into the pond!

190
00:11:47,561 --> 00:11:48,040
Humph.

191
00:11:48,841 --> 00:11:51,681
That ungrateful girl never
stopped causing trouble.

192
00:11:52,400 --> 00:11:54,080
In the past, over Prince of Rong,

193
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,521
how many times did she threaten
to kill herself?

194
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:57,040
Did she ever actually die?

195
00:11:57,641 --> 00:11:58,641
Exactly, Madam Bai.

196
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:00,360
You're about to give birth.

197
00:12:00,761 --> 00:12:02,761
You should focus on resting
and keeping the baby safe.

198
00:12:02,841 --> 00:12:04,801
Don't run around,
or it'll hurt the baby.

199
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:05,721
You...

200
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,120
You all...

201
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:10,801
Madam Bai!

202
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:13,601
My dear, Madam Bai won't listen
to reason.

203
00:12:13,801 --> 00:12:15,120
Why don't we go take a look?

204
00:12:15,561 --> 00:12:16,601
Nothing but trouble.

205
00:12:16,801 --> 00:12:17,801
Let her be.

206
00:12:22,641 --> 00:12:24,961
Boss, can you hurry up?

207
00:12:25,681 --> 00:12:27,761
You've looked back a thousand times
this morning.

208
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:30,801
This has been just an unexpected trip.

209
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,761
Trips always come to an end.

210
00:12:32,881 --> 00:12:33,881
Come on, let's go.

211
00:12:34,160 --> 00:12:35,320
Come on, hurry up.

212
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:37,280
Got it. Let's go.

213
00:12:37,280 --> 00:12:37,847
Let's go.

214
00:12:42,921 --> 00:12:43,480
Boss.

215
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,160
Feng Weiyue.

216
00:13:06,721 --> 00:13:07,521
Mo Yuya.

217
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:10,200
Wait, don't say anything.

218
00:13:10,961 --> 00:13:12,681
I have to go back. I will go back.

219
00:13:14,001 --> 00:13:15,681
But after what you said to me yesterday,

220
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:17,641
I'm actually a little conflicted now.

221
00:13:18,160 --> 00:13:19,801
If you ask me to stay again now,

222
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,001
I...

223
00:13:22,961 --> 00:13:24,320
That's not why I'm here.

224
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:27,440
Something's happened to your mother.

225
00:13:29,601 --> 00:13:30,360
What happened to her?

226
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:50,360
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

227
00:13:50,567 --> 00:13:52,880
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

228
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:56,920
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

229
00:13:57,407 --> 00:13:59,727
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

230
00:14:00,713 --> 00:14:03,720
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

231
00:14:04,287 --> 00:14:06,520
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

232
00:14:07,653 --> 00:14:12,133
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

233
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:17,400
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

234
00:14:18,033 --> 00:14:20,720
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

235
00:14:21,894 --> 00:14:24,520
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

236
00:14:24,873 --> 00:14:27,080
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

237
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:31,240
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

238
00:14:31,593 --> 00:14:33,960
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

239
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:35,880
♪This love remains unchanged♪

240
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:39,400
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

241
00:14:41,133 --> 00:14:43,573
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

242
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:47,640
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

243
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:50,440
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

244
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:52,340
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

245
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:54,080
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

246
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:57,440
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

247
00:14:57,440 --> 00:15:01,760
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

248
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:04,120
♪I don't regret that vow♪

249
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:07,600
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
